FNV-GAME licensing scope
========================

The MIT License below applies to the original contributions to FNV-GAME for
which gavinbrow holds copyright, wherever those contributions appear in this
repository. This includes original additions and changes to source code and
headers in fnv_decomp/ and FNV/, as well as build, maintenance and testing
tools, generators and documentation. It also applies to contributions whose
copyright holders expressly make them available under these terms.

Covered contributions may be used, modified and redistributed free of charge,
including commercially, subject to retaining the copyright and permission
notices below. Those notices provide the required attribution. CREDITS.md
records additional project and upstream acknowledgements.

This permission covers only the original material and rights held by the
licensing contributor. A change to an upstream file does not relicense that
file's pre-existing contents. No permission is granted here for upstream
contributors' work, third-party software, or code, data, assets, resources and
executables owned by the original game's rights holders. Their existing
notices and terms remain in effect, including fnv_decomp/LICENSE, which grants
no licence to that upstream project's source or contributions. Mixed files
remain subject to the rights in their pre-existing contents; this licence
alone does not authorize reuse of the whole file or reconstructed game.

This licence grants no rights in Fallout: New Vegas or its trademarks. See
CREDITS.md for attribution and upstream notices. Git history identifies the
FNV-GAME changes but is not, by itself, proof of copyright ownership.

